---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { apiPrices } from '../lib/data';

const calculablePrices = apiPrices.filter((item) => item.status === 'verified');
const clientData = JSON.stringify(calculablePrices).replaceAll('<', '\\u003c');
---
<BaseLayout title="成本计算器" description="按每月输入、输出和缓存 Token 用量计算已核验模型的 USD 成本。">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Cost calculator</div>
    <h1>月度 Token 成本计算器</h1>
    <p class="lede">公式为各类 Token 数量 ÷ 1,000,000 × 对应单价，再求和。DeepSeek 请按实际请求时段选择峰值或低谷口径。</p>
  </section>
  <div class="calculator">
    <form class="card" id="cost-form">
      <label>模型与计价口径
        <select name="model">{calculablePrices.map((item) => <option value={item.id}>{item.provider} · {item.model}</option>)}</select>
      </label>
      <div class="usage-grid section">
        <label>Input Token / 月<input name="input" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="1000000" inputmode="numeric" required /></label>
        <label>Output Token / 月<input name="output" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="100000" inputmode="numeric" required /></label>
        <label>Cache read Token / 月<input name="cacheRead" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0" inputmode="numeric" required /></label>
        <label>Cache write Token / 月<input name="cacheWrite" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0" inputmode="numeric" required /></label>
      </div>
    </form>
    <section class="result" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="meta">估算月成本（USD）</span>
      <div class="result-output" id="cost-result">—</div>
      <p id="cost-detail">选择模型并填写每月用量。</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="callout section"><p>结果只包含表中四类 Token 费用，不含缓存存储费、工具调用、税费或其他附加费用。缺少某类价格且对应使用量大于 0 时，计算会直接停止。</p></div>
  <noscript><p class="callout section">成本计算器需要启用 JavaScript；价格表与数据口径页面无需 JavaScript 即可阅读。</p></noscript>
  <script id="calculator-data" type="application/json" set:html={clientData}></script>
  <script src="../scripts/calculator.ts"></script>
</BaseLayout>
